The GLM prompt latent AOT integration embeds unmodified production TensorFold
Triton sparse-onepass and BF16 absorb/expand kernels. Local changes provide
native ownership, validation, prompt dispatch and numerical/cache identity.
Their exact source/image/compiler/payload provenance and retained original
license are in zig/src/families/glm/prompt_aot/; the Mia and wojo lineage and
transitive credits above remain applicable.
